# Current branch is ancestor of given branch (fast-forward)
> init
<<<
+ a.txt wug.txt
> add a.txt
<<<
> commit "v1"
<<<

> branch feature
<<<
> checkout feature
<<<
+ a.txt notwug.txt
> add a.txt
<<<
> commit "v2 on feature"
<<<

> checkout master
<<<
> merge feature
Current branch fast-forwarded.
<<<
= a.txt notwug.txt
